# Working-repo .gitignore guard (ISI-5759, child of ISI-5743 plan §8).
# Belt-and-suspenders: keep internal-only content out of accidental stages/pushes.
# NOTE: this is the INTERNAL working repo. The PUBLIC repo gets its own
# .gitignore under ISI-5756 and is built by explicit construction, not by
# excluding these paths. Files already committed here stay tracked; these
# patterns block NEW untracked content from being staged by accident.

# Internal-only content directories
presentation/
presentation-matrix/
loadtests/
research/
exports/

# Python / tooling caches (never commit)
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
*cache*/
